                                                                'ProjectEndingConditionChoices.choices(in: '
                                                                'model.draft, operation: "HAS_TAG"), '
                                                                'oldValue: '
                                                                'ProjectStoryConditionChoice.currentValue(target, '
                                                                'in: model.draft))\n'
